```
This interface simplifies user profiles by only tracking if a user has a balance rather than their precise account balance, streamlining the database.

```typescript
interface UserProfile {
  id: string;
  username: string;
  email: string;
  bio: string;
  posts: Array<{ title: string; content: string }> | [];
}
```
Having optional fields and allowing the `posts` array to be empty is fine, so you don’t need to make it `Array<{ title: string; content: string }> | null`.

```typescript
